---
// red-green 통합 채널은 2026-08 리브랜딩으로 red / green 두 개의 독립 채널로 분리됨.
// 어느 한쪽으로 단정할 수 없어 자동 리다이렉트 대신 선택 안내 페이지로 전환.
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/channel-page.css';
---
<Layout title="taerijay+red / taerijay+green | TAERIJAY">
  <div class="channel-page">
    <div class="channel-topbar">
      <button type="button" class="back-btn" onclick="history.back()">← 뒤로가기</button>
    </div>
    <section class="channel-hero">
      <span class="channel-category">BEAUTY</span>
      <h1 class="channel-title">taerijay+red / taerijay+green</h1>
      <p class="channel-sub">taerijay+red+green 채널은 taerijay+red, taerijay+green 두 개의 독립 채널로 분리되었습니다. 원하는 채널을 선택해주세요.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="cat-grid-section">
      <a href="/04-channels/red" class="cat-card" style="--c:#E1261C">
        <div class="cat-card-art">
          <span class="cat-card-name notranslate" translate="no">taerijay+red</span>
          <span class="cat-card-name-en">Uniform-Price Living Store Beauty</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/04-channels/green" class="cat-card" style="--c:#6F8B2E">
        <div class="cat-card-art">
          <span class="cat-card-name notranslate" translate="no">taerijay+green</span>
          <span class="cat-card-name-en">H&B Store Beauty</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
